      "ordinal": 4,
      "title": "Responsive collapsible Icon-only drawer sidebar. Using is-drawer-close and is-drawer-open",
      "line": 219,
      "axis": null,
      "description": "In this example instead of completely hiding the drawer sidebar, we only show the icons when the drawer is closed. To add styles based on the state of the drawer, we use the `is-drawer-open` and `is-drawer-close` variants. For example `is-drawer-close:hidden` or `is-drawer-open:w-80`. Also we have tooltips when the drawer is closed and a switch button to open/close the drawer and rotates the button icon based on the state of the drawer.",
      "descriptionLine": 221,
      "liveHtml": "<div class=\"drawer lg:drawer-open h-80\">\n  <input id=\"my-drawer-4\" type=\"checkbox\" autocomplete=\"off\" class=\"drawer-toggle inline\" />\n  <div class=\"drawer-content\">\n    <!-- Navbar -->\n    <nav class=\"navbar w-full bg-base-300\">\n      <label for=\"my-drawer-4\" aria-label=\"open sidebar\" class=\"btn btn-square btn-ghost drawer-button\">\n        <!-- Sidebar toggle icon -->\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"my-1.5 inline-block size-4\"><path d=\"M4 4m0 2a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-12a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2z\"></path><path d=\"M9 4v16\"></path><path d=\"M14 10l2 2l-2 2\"></path></svg>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"px-4\">Navbar Title</div>\n    </nav>\n    <!-- Page content here -->\n    <div class=\"p-4\">Page Content</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"drawer-side max-lg:top-16 lg:h-80 is-drawer-close:overflow-visible\">\n    <label for=\"my-drawer-4\" aria-label=\"close sidebar\" class=\"drawer-overlay\"></label>\n    <div class=\"flex min-h-full flex-col items-start bg-base-200 is-drawer-close:w-14 is-drawer-open:w-64\">\n      <!-- Sidebar content here -->\n      <ul class=\"menu w-full grow\">\n        <!-- List item -->\n        <li>\n          <button class=\"is-drawer-close:tooltip is-drawer-close:tooltip-right\" data-tip=\"Homepage\">\n            <!-- Home icon -->\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"my-1.5 inline-block size-4\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg>\n            <span class=\"is-drawer-close:hidden\">Homepage</span>\n          </button>\n        </li>\n        <!-- List item -->\n        <li>\n          <button class=\"is-drawer-close:tooltip is-drawer-close:tooltip-right\" data-tip=\"Settings\">\n            <!-- Settings icon -->\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"my-1.5 inline-block size-4\"><path d=\"M20 7h-9\"></path><path d=\"M14 17H5\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>\n            <span class=\"is-drawer-close:hidden\">Settings</span>\n          </button>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
